      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا ٱفْتُثَّ بَنُو فُلَانٍ قَطُّ</span></b>  means <i>The sons of such
a one have not been overcome,</i> or <i>subdued, hitherto,</i>
or <i>ever.</i> (AA, O, K. *)

